abstract: >-
  R code for deriving the UK Biobank individualised, sleep-anchored timing
  of the 24-h moderate-to-vigorous physical activity distribution using
  GGIR 3.0.0/HDCZA sleep timing, a wear-time-weighted circular MVPA centroid,
  resultant vector length, exposure quality control, and the sleep-anchored
  phase angle.
